# Project facts

Autobiography from real diary entries. Author is non-technical. Writing support only — tooling stays invisible.

## Draft roles

| Role | Location |
|------|----------|
| Working book | `current manuscript/` |
| May voice reference | `legacy/exports/may26.txt` (helpers; local) |
| May check pages (side-by-side) | `may check/` only — never inside `current manuscript/` |
| Pages archive | `legacy/` — do not edit `.pages` |
| Diary source | `diary enteries/` — never overwrite with chapter drafts |
| Goal / bookmark | `story planning/current-goal.md` · `where-we-left-off.md` |

## Truth

- No invented people, dates, places, or events.  
- Ask before changing facts or chronology.  
- Light touch after Gemini rewrite — no mass rewrites.

## Folders

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `current manuscript/` | Chapters + contents |
| `story planning/` | Outline, timeline, goal, bookmark |
| `diary enteries/` | Dated source notes (keep spelling) |
| `general references/` | Research |
| `legacy/` | Old Pages + exports |

## Safety

- No large deletes without confirmation.  
- No force-push / history rewrite.  
- Voice, confirm, Tim → **mum-voice** rule. Session flow → **organiser** rule.
